ect all the red cars, eat only the donuts, or use the boosters to add to yourself time! It’s the perfect mix of relaxing gameplay and a fun brain challenge.\n\nKey Features:\nUNIQUE PUZZLE MECHANICS: More than just an io game! Each level is a new brain teaser.\nINCREDIBLY SATISFYING: The feeling of clearing the map and collecting objects is super relaxing.\nVIBRANT & COLORFUL WORLDS: Explore dozens of beautiful, hand-crafted levels.\nEASY ONE-FINGER CONTROLS: Simple to learn, but hard to master!\n\nHow to Grow Your Black Hole:\nDRAG your finger to move the hole across the map.\nCHECK the mission at the top of the screen.\nEAT only the specific items required to solve the puzzle.\nGROW bigger with every object you swallow!\nCLEAR the board to become the ultimate puzzle solver!\n\nUnlike other io games where you just eat everything, Hole it! challenges you to think before you eat. It’s not about being the biggest, it’s about being the smartest! It’s the attack hole game for puzzle lovers.\n\nThe challenge awaits! Are you ready to test your brain and have a ton of fun?\nDownload Hole it for FREE and start your puzzle-swallowing adventure NOW!", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.58524, "sellerUrl": "https://supersonic.com/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "487934976", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "12+", "bundleId": "com.rocket.holeit", "trackCensoredName": "Hole It 3D", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/hole-it-3d/id6740699102?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "userRatingCount": 393}]}